## 💻 Local Setup (Quick Guide)

### Linux/Mac Setup

```bash
# Make setup script executable
chmod +x setup.sh

# Run setup
./setup.sh

# Run the application
./run.sh
```

### Windows Setup

```bash
# Run setup script
setup-windows.bat

# Run the application (choose option from menu)
python gui.py
```

### Docker Setup (All Platforms)

```bash
# Start all services
docker-compose up -d

# Check services
docker-compose ps

# View logs
docker-compose logs -f

# Stop services
docker-compose down
```

